  "notes": {
    "existing": "Current rifle/carbine/lmg/pistol files remain in Assets/audio/ until runtime paths migrate into weapons/.",
    "missingFiles": "Weapons/grenades/vehicles/aircraft/ambience categories above are mostly still planned filenames. Every callout in voices/us and voices/ge now exists.",
    "voices": "callouts.<faction>.events is what the runtime (battle/squad-ai.js, battle/acoustics.js) actually reads: an array of alternate-take file paths per event key, picked at random per line to avoid repetition. callouts.<faction>.generation is the source-of-truth text/voice script behind those files; callouts.<faction>.voiceDirection describes the intended character/performance. See Assets/audio/VOICE_GENERATION.md for how these are synthesized and how to regenerate or extend them."
  }
